abstract: >-
  Lokomotif Kit is the open-source methodology core for Corporate AI
  Adoption. It publishes the RTCSG prompt architecture, the AI
  Maturity Spectrum, and the Three-Horizon Adoption Journey as JSON
  schemas, a TypeScript composition SDK, a Python evaluation harness,
  a CLI, and runtime adapters (Anthropic SDK, Dify, n8n, LangGraph).
  The Kit is model-agnostic and runtime-agnostic by design; vendor
  adapters live in dedicated blueprint packages so the methodology
  surface stays portable.
